{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Deep Conversations: Date Night 是一款為情侶而設的對話提問工具，透過多元問題引導雙方分享想法、認識彼此，適合約會夜、公路旅行或在家相處時使用。原價 US $19.99，現時終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費中。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-158.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>情侶深度對話問題庫</h2>\n<p>程式提供破冰、深度問題、二選一、你認識我嗎、浪漫、未來夢想與日常生活等分類，讓伴侶以輕鬆而有意義的問題展開交流。透過互相提問與誠實分享，雙方可以發現彼此不同的一面，加深理解並拉近距離；無論約會夜、公路旅行或安靜在家，都能隨時開啟有質素的對話。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-135-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Deep Conversations: Date Night 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Deep Conversations: Date Night</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/deep-conversations-date-night/id6754443107\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.222737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:29:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:52:01.540889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:10.724166+00:00","content_hash":"53097cfb7614460dc5149316e0e8853976c45f1a21a36e5db1e0766edebbe5a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}